                    </h1>
                    <p class="mt-7 max-w-[62ch] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-fg-muted md:text-base">
                        The numeric value behind each level, the two gates every record passes through, and working code to set the level from <code>basicConfig</code>, a <code>--log-level</code> flag, a <code>LOG_LEVEL</code> variable or <code>dictConfig</code>.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-x-5 gap-y-2 font-mono text-[10px] text-fg-muted">
                        <span>By Maple</span>
                        <time datetime={published}>Updated {updatedLabel}</time>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-deep p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 md:p-5" aria-label="Python logging levels at a glance">
                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border pb-3 font-mono text-[10px] text-fg-muted">
                        <span>logging / levels</span>
                        <span class="text-primary">root default: WARNING</span>
                    </div>
                    <ol class="divide-y divide-border">
                        {[
                            ["50", "CRITICAL", "alias FATAL"],
                            ["40", "ERROR", "logger.exception() logs here"],
                            ["30", "WARNING", "alias WARN · root default"],
                            ["20", "INFO", "hidden by default"],
                            ["10", "DEBUG", "hidden by default"],
                            ["0", "NOTSET", "inherit from parent"],
                        ].map(([value, name, detail]) => (
                            <li class="grid grid-cols-[2rem_1fr] gap-3 py-3">
